1
00:00:00,056 --> 00:00:02,956
(Sheldon(shouting):)We've gotten a little off-topic.

2
00:00:02,959 --> 00:00:05,289
(Sheldon(shouting):)Allow me to make things
entertaining again

3
00:00:05,295 --> 00:00:08,165
(Sheldon(shouting):)in this little Spockumentary.

4
00:00:12,093 --> 00:00:14,133
(Sheldon(shouting):)That was Leonard's joke.

5
00:00:20,714 --> 00:00:23,784
(Sheldon(shouting):)As a child,
when faced with a dilemma,

6
00:00:23,784 --> 00:00:27,214
(Sheldon(shouting):)my mother encouraged me to ask,
“What would Jesus do?”

7
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:30,590
(Sheldon(shouting):)The answer to that was always,
“Love thy neighbor.”

8
00:00:30,591 --> 00:00:35,091
But my neighbor had
a dead tooth, so...

9
00:00:35,095 --> 00:00:37,265
(Sheldon(shouting):)that wasn't going to happen.

10
00:00:37,264 --> 00:00:39,094
(Howard:)But...

11
00:00:39,099 --> 00:00:43,239
(Sheldon(shouting):)that's why I changed it
to, “What would Spock do?”

12
00:00:43,236 --> 00:00:44,836
(Adam:)Did you find that helpful?

13
00:00:44,838 --> 00:00:47,638
(Sheldon:)Yes. Oh, for example,
three years ago

14
00:00:47,641 --> 00:00:50,411
(Sheldon:)when I discovered Penny
was eating all my Pop-Tarts,

15
00:00:50,410 --> 00:00:53,180
(Sheldon:)instead of getting angry
or vindictive,

16
00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:55,810
(Sheldon:)you know, I got a floor safe.

